sequenceDiagram
    actor Passenger
    participant Fare as Phase 5 FareService
    participant Booking as BookingService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Passenger->>Fare: Create quote for journey and passenger categories
    Fare->>DB: Store immutable quote, owner, rule version, amount, expiry
    Fare-->>Passenger: Quote ID and itemized fare
    Passenger->>Booking: Booking request with quote ID and idempotency key
    Booking->>Fare: Validate owned, unexpired quote
    Booking->>DB: Match stored journey, class, currency, and total
    Booking->>DB: Copy immutable fare snapshot and payable amount
    DB-->>Booking: Booking transaction committed
    Booking-->>Passenger: RailConnect reference, AWAITING_PAYMENT, deadline
